BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fuessen-2026-hohenschwangau-klassik-bergkonzert-konigliche@garylewis
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260802T150802Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T090000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T100000
SUMMARY:Hohenschwangau Klassik: Bergkonzert Königliche Trompetenklänge
LOCATION:Ort der Besinnung\, Bergstation Tegelbergbahn\, Schwangau
DESCRIPTION:Mountain-top concert of the Hohenschwangau Klassik festival wit
 h trumpeters Georg Hiemer\, Martin Ehlich and Daniel Noske\, a brass trump
 et trio in the high Alps. Moves to the Panoramarestaurant in case of rain.
  Entry is free on the Pay as you want principle\; the Tegelbergbahn runs s
 pecial early rides from 8:30 at regular fares. Info at hohenschwangau-klas
 sik.com.
URL:https://veranstaltungen.erlebe.bayern/schwangau/bergkonzert-koenigliche
 -trompetenklaenge-e7a8aabe01a770e224c6908292cf3bd6d.html
CATEGORIES:classical
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
