SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260802T150802Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T180000
SUMMARY:Mittelaltermarkt Füssen (letzter Markttag)
LOCATION:Von-Freyberg-Park\, Füssen
DESCRIPTION:Final day of the three day Mittelaltermarkt that turns the Von-
 Freyberg-Park near the station into a medieval village with craft stalls\,
  music stages and performers. Sunday opening hours are 10:00 to 18:00 and 
 admission is free. Info at mittelaltermarkt-fuessen.de.
URL:https://vehi-mercatus.de/marktkalender/mittelaltermarkt-fussen-2026/
CATEGORIES:town
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fuessen-2026-24-tegelberglauf-tegelberg-nachwuchslauf@garylewis
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260802T150802Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T120000
SUMMARY:24. Tegelberglauf und Tegelberg Nachwuchslauf
LOCATION:Tegelberg\, Schwangau
DESCRIPTION:The 24. Tegelberglauf of TSV Schwangau is an 8 km mountain run 
 with about 920 m of climbing up the Tegelberg\, held today\, Sunday 2 Augu
 st\, from 10:00. The Tegelberg Nachwuchslauf for kids and youth aged 6 to 
 15 runs alongside the main race. Online registration is closed but Nachmel
 dungen are possible on site\; info at www2.tsv-schwangau.de/tegelberglauf.
URL:https://www.runme.de/deutschland/tegelberglauf-schwangau/
CATEGORIES:running
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fuessen-2026-korperwelten-zyklus-des-lebens@garylewis
SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260802T150802Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T100000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T180000
SUMMARY:KÖRPERWELTEN & Der Zyklus des Lebens (Ausstellung bis 11.10.2026)
LOCATION:bigBOX ALLGÄU\, Kotterner Str. 62-64\, Kempten
DESCRIPTION:The famous anatomy exhibition by Dr. Gunther von Hagens runs at
  the bigBOX ALLGÄU in Kempten until 11 October 2026. Real plastinated bod
 ies show how the human body works\, which curious kids often find fascinat
 ing. Open Mon to Fri 9:00 to 18:00 and Sat\, Sun and holidays 10:00 to 18:
 00\, last admission 17:00. Time window tickets at koerperwelten.de or Even
 tim.
URL:https://koerperwelten.de/stadt/kempten/
CATEGORIES:science
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
