SEQUENCE:0
DTSTAMP:20260802T150802Z
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T203000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Berlin:20260802T223000
SUMMARY:Neuschwanstein Konzerte: Für immer! Gebaute Träume\, gelebte Musi
 k
LOCATION:Schlosshof Schloss Neuschwanstein\, Hohenschwangau
DESCRIPTION:Closing night of the Neuschwanstein Konzerte 2026 open-air fest
 ival in the upper castle courtyard\, the successor of the famous Sängersa
 al Schlosskonzerte. Tenor Piotr Beczala\, soprano Olga Peretyatko and mezz
 o-soprano Nadezhda Karyazina sing opera by Offenbach\, Gounod and Verdi wi
 th the Münchner Symphoniker under Andreas Klippert. Admission from 19:30\
 , ticket includes parking in Hohenschwangau and shuttle to the castle. Tic
 kets at neuschwansteinkonzerte.eu or Eventim\, hotline +49 831 2065555.
URL:https://www.neuschwansteinkonzerte.eu/en/program-2/
CATEGORIES:classical
STATUS:CONFIRMED
